      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I'd recommend Green Coast Solar to anyone who is looking for a solid solar installation. Unlike all those companies who advertise unbelievable cheap solar deals on facebook, Green Coast actually do a site inspection when quating for the job so there will be no nasty surprises and expensive variations on the day. The gear is tier one and my 7.6 kw system was installed in less then 6 hours including the removal of an old system and they also cleaned up cable ends etc... Ashley and his team and real professionals. Customer service was great during the order process and I am yet to need to contact them after the installation.",
