    {
      "review_id": "105534",
      "reviewer_name": "Michael",
      "reviewer_location": "QLD - 4069",
      "reviewer_state": "QLD",
      "reviewer_postcode": "4069",
      "reviewer_postcode_valid": true,
      "review_date": "2022-11-20",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "SALES PROCESS:The quoting process was excellent. Unlike some installers, Ashley (the owner) and Marlin came in person. This gave me confidence as I got to have a face to face conversation with the people who’ll be doing the installation and not some unknown sub-contractors.They came with 2 options, a 6.6kW and a 8kW system. Ashley actually recommend the smaller 6.6kW system after getting to know my usage and requirement. Ashley spotted my switch box needs to be relocated and being an electrician himself he was able to gave me a good price on the spot.Green Coast wasn’t the cheapest quote I got; however, I felt they know their stuff and most importantly Ashley and Marlin were genuine. The price quoted was fair and there was still room for negotiation.INSTALLATION:The installation was top notch. Looked great. Ashley took care of the inverter and installed it in the garage as requested. Marlin was up on the roof with the panels. There was also an apprentice sparky there on the day. Because of the placement of the panels, my antenna had to be moved and Marlin was very happy to cater to my relocation requests and kept me informed all the way. Being a tiled roof, I was expecting ‘some’ tiles to break but I was pleasantly surprised that none were broken after the install.CUSTOMER SERVICE:Karen, who looks after administration, kept me informed throughout and did all the paperwork with the electricity company. Also I had some questions post the install and Ashley was more than happy to take my call and answered my questions.I will do a follow up review in a few months’ time after I get my first bill.",
